<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12192" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπληστ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>insatiate desire, greediness,</i>
			whether of food or money, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τῆς ἀπληστίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecr.
					156
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τοσαύτην ἀ. ἀφίκοντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					12.19
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				36.44
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ τὴν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					493b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τρόπων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					22.67
				</span></i>
			 (interpol.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαστρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.360
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen. rei,
				<i>insatiate desire of,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλούτου, χρυσοῦ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				562b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				831d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέχους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					218
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς εὐχῆς,</span> referring to
			Midas, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1257b16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ θεωρεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.12
				</span></i>
			.</div>
